  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Gateron Low Profile (KS-27 & KS-33) style mechanical keyboard switch, through-hole soldering, single-sided mounting. Gateron Low Profile and Cherry MX Low Profile are NOT compatible. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile). Keycap: 2.00u (courtyard 38.05x19.00mm). Kailh Choc V2 stabilizer (CPG1353G24D01): PCB cutout slots (Edge.Cuts). Plate required; plate cutout per Keebio plate generator. For Choc V2 / Gateron KS-33 only (not Choc V1).")
